# Calculator P0 patch — 2026-09-04
# Style: FIND/REPLACE document (line-number-independent, survives head/CTA edits).
# NOT git-apply-able by design. Adam reviews and applies by hand.
# No math is touched by any edit below.
#
# Covers 4 P0s:
#   P0-1  Invisible hero H1 + subhead on 3 calculator pages (white text on cream)  — 1 file, 2 edits
#   P0-2  rate-buydown on-screen schedule "Principal"/"Interest" headers swapped   — 1 file, 1 edit (12+ weeks open)
#   P0-3  7 unlabeled form controls (5 wrap + 2 refinance) — WCAG AA               — 2 files, 7 edits
